  {
   "name": "Stereo Swarm",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "pad",
   "tags": [
    "per-voice pan",
    "motion",
    "ambient"
   ],
   "description": "Every note lives its own life. A per-note LFO circles it around the stereo field from a random phase, higher notes orbit faster and each note at its own speed. A random LFO per note wanders its pitch, cutoff, position and osc balance, every note is detuned by its own few cents, and a slow envelope opens some notes and closes others. Mod wheel: wider orbits; aftertouch: resonance. Macros: orbit, orbit speed, brightness, wander.",
