  {
   "name": "Future Chords",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "pad",
   "tags": [
    "supersaw",
    "sidechain pump",
    "future bass",
    "OTT"
   ],
   "description": "Future-bass chords: a seven-voice supersaw and an octave above, every chord scooping up into pitch, with a filter envelope on each stab. A drawn quarter-note duck pumps the volume like a sidechain from the chord's first beat, the detune breathes slowly, each note is a few cents apart, and the three-band compressor squashes it OTT-style. Mod wheel: a vibrato wobble on the whole chord; aftertouch: brighter. Macros: pump, brightness, squash, wobble.",
