  {
   "name": "Feedback Lead",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "lead",
   "tags": [
    "phase modulation",
    "feedback",
    "mono"
   ],
   "description": "Oscillator 1 phase-modulates itself (osc mix: PM 1 feedback), from a sine towards a saw. A mod envelope and velocity open the feedback on each note's attack, a slow per-note LFO keeps it turning between hollow and buzzy, and the feedback eases off for high notes; osc 2 adds a sine sub. Mod wheel: more vibrato; aftertouch: more feedback. Macros: feedback, sub.",
