  {
   "name": "Overwrought Sync",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "lead",
   "tags": [
    "hard sync",
    "mono",
    "reverse delay",
    "XY random walk"
   ],
   "description": "After Oatmeal's overwrought: a mono hard-sync lead whose synced pulse climbs two octaves over a couple of seconds and sinks back over eight, while resonant noise and a vibrato swell in. The XY pad's random walk wanders the sync pitch and the cutoff, the pulse width moves, and the delay plays its echoes backwards. Mod wheel: sweep the sync by hand; aftertouch: drive. Macros: sweep, noise, wander.",
