  {
   "name": "Rise Machine",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "fx",
   "tags": [
    "riser",
    "envelope curves",
    "supersaw"
   ],
   "description": "Hold a chord for an eight-second riser: a slow mod envelope, curved to accelerate towards the top, raises the cutoff, the pitch, the resonance and the unison detune, brings in noise and speeds up a tremolo that turns into a flutter at the top, then holds there. Macros: pitch rise.",
